        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI 4850, Square Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt (keyed on the outside and thumb turn on the inside). These Grade 1 high security deadbolts fit standard pre-drilled doors. All the exterior components, including the deadbolt, thumb turn, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Both the outside and inside square housing plates are made from 1/2\" thick solid stainless steel.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by a key from exterior and by a thumb turn from the interior\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the AHI Square Single Cylinder Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>ANSI Grade 1 Security</li>\r\n<li>20 Minute UL Fire Rated</li>\r\n<li>6 Pin Schlage C Keyway for Security</li>\r\n<li>Optional 2 3/8\" or 2 3/4\" Backset </li>\r\n<li>1\" Deadbolt with Hardened Steel Core for Extra Security</li>\r\n<li>Fit Standard 2-1/8\" Pre-Drilled Doors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the AHI 4850 Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Marine Grade 316 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rosette Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" to 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SIG4850-install.pdf?v=1691093355\" target=\"new\"><b>AHI 4850 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
