                "description": "AHI 4850 Stainless Steel Square Single Cylinder Deadbolts. Stainless Steel Single Cylinder Deadbolt (keyed on the outside and thumb turn on the inside). These Grade 1 high security deadbolts fit standard pre-drilled doors.  All the exterior components, including the deadbolt, thumb turn, screws and strike plates are stainless steel. Both the outside and inside square housing plates are made from 1/2 inch thick solid stainless steel.",
